                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-m3-on-surface">2-Min Joint Check</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-m3-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-0.5">Reports 15m early in uniform. Joint fuel &amp; odometer note.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-m3-xl bg-m3-surface border border-m3-outline-variant/60 flex items-start gap-2.5">
